# 7.10 Real Industrial Workflow

Industrial quantum optimization typically follows a hybrid workflow.

```
Business Problem
        ↓
Data Collection
        ↓
Problem Modeling
        ↓
QUBO Formulation
        ↓
Quantum Annealing
        ↓
Candidate Solutions
        ↓
Classical Verification
        ↓
Business Decision
```

Rather than replacing classical computers,

Quantum Annealing works together with classical optimization software.

This hybrid approach represents the current industrial standard.

